From 71a6ce75b5fab07b137609c3392c03daa9546ec6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:37:57 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Move viewport controls to a grouped left sidebar and free
 the 3D view
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Replace the floating bottom dock with a collapsible left sidebar so the
  3D viewport is no longer occluded.
- Group controls into collapsible dropdown sections: Arquivo & Exportação,
  Visualização, Animação, Rig & UV, Exibição & Ferramentas, PBR ao Vivo.
- Move the HDRI environment panel into the sidebar (collapsed by default).
- Fix the viewport height collapsing to 0 inside the flex column layout.
- Adjust the mesh hierarchy drawer height now that the bottom dock is gone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KuTvR2mbcF4at8X31tztrB
