Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Fix sample model loading and section collapse
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Fix infinite recursion (stack overflow) when loading any non-skinned
  mesh: outline meshes were added as children while traversing the model.
  Snapshot the nodes before modifying the tree.
- Bundle a CC0 sample (Avocado.glb) in public/models so the "Exemplo"
  button works offline and in sandboxed previews.
- Show the real error detail when the sample model fails to load.
- Move the Luz & Render and Materiais & Pintura panels inside the
  "Exibição & Ferramentas" section so collapsing it hides them too.

